    row("This Privacy Policy applies to the application CatsBlock Weather (the \"App\"), published by CatsBlock Corporation (\"CatsBlock Corporation\", \"we\", \"us\").", "Esta Política de Privacidade se aplica ao aplicativo CatsBlock Weather (o \"App\"), publicado pela CatsBlock Corporation (\"CatsBlock Corporation\", \"nós\").", "Esta Política de Privacidade aplica-se à aplicação CatsBlock Weather (a \"App\"), publicada pela CatsBlock Corporation (\"CatsBlock Corporation\", \"nós\").", "Esta Política de privacidad se aplica a la aplicación CatsBlock Weather (la \"App\"), publicada por CatsBlock Corporation (\"CatsBlock Corporation\", \"nosotros\").", "La présente Politique de confidentialité s'applique à l'application CatsBlock Weather (l'« App »), publiée par CatsBlock Corporation (« CatsBlock Corporation », « nous »).", "Настоящая Политика конфиденциальности относится к приложению CatsBlock Weather («Приложение»), опубликованному CatsBlock Corporation («CatsBlock Corporation», «мы»).", "Diese Datenschutzerklärung gilt für die Anwendung CatsBlock Weather (die „App“), herausgegeben von CatsBlock Corporation („CatsBlock Corporation“, „wir“).", "La presente Informativa sulla privacy si applica all'applicazione CatsBlock Weather (l'«App»), pubblicata da CatsBlock Corporation («CatsBlock Corporation», «noi»).", "본 개인정보 처리방침은 CatsBlock Corporation(이하 \"CatsBlock Corporation\", \"당사\")이 발행하는 CatsBlock Weather 애플리케이션(이하 \"앱\")에 적용됩니다.", "Kebijakan Privasi ini berlaku untuk aplikasi CatsBlock Weather (\"Aplikasi\") yang diterbitkan oleh CatsBlock Corporation (\"CatsBlock Corporation\", \"kami\")."),
